<p>In this video I provide an overview of the default interface for minibuffer completions in Emacs. This is an interface that has been improved considerably over the years. In Emacs version 31, this interface gets some nice new features which make it even more appealing to use.</p>

<p>Below is the article I prepared for this video, with all the code samples.</p>

